report='''# Phosphate758 admission disposition
+
+Defer both W08 staged fragments. Do not install the existing TARGET023 union or the isolated dihydrate edit. Preserve the distinct W07 monohydrate contribution through its exact published payload and an explicit native serialization bridge, subject to B's distinct complete residual review. No full three-owner758 transaction or NCIT promotion is proposed for this campaign.
+
+The exact W08 proposals if-add-mono-source-spelling and if-reject-monohydrate-on-dihydrate explicitly say BLOCKED AS ISOLATED APPLICATION. Their coupled scope requires both alias changes, six source-label overrides, and the three owners' memberships/counts. The actual original934-operation plan contains the two fragments but no anhydrous owner operation. All six exact required overrides are absent from the complete current A842 override dictionary (ignored-independent direct file/AST read); existing differently spelled overrides do not satisfy these six keys. No native membership refresh was executed. Stored counts and membership-table counts are captured separately and are not declared interchangeable or scientifically resolved.
+
+TARGET0238e383 combines W07b58c (one independently source-supported orthophosphate monohydrate alias and one original event) with W08e799 (three monohydrate spellings, a staged758 transfer). Its authentic beforeimage ise116. The other op ORIGINAL-w08::if-reject-monohydrate-on-dihydrate selects normalized7e689 from W08original3dcb, authenticbeforea22. The compound delta is not an isolated, independent cleanup. The old admissibility rows incorrectly carry no specific758 precondition; combined37 review32c4 assessed the combined bytes, not this residual choice. Historical reviews remain unchanged and do not override the original explicit application hold.
+
+The genuine W07 source contribution is separable: publishedb58c differs from authentic e116 only by its orthophosphate monohydrate alias and original W07 event. Exact primary TOGO M2237 capture7fd15659 and ChEBI114249 captureb3325690 support it. It neither imports the three W08 labels nor changes identity, roles, counts or membership. Native serialization6555960f is a separate equal-typed-object, idempotent capture, not a newly published original and not new science/history. All original union bytes/history remain evidence. Root/B review must bind bothb58c and655 and the new source selection rather than reusing union approval.
+
+Current full NCI EVS/OLS supports specific NCIT:C66551 Sodium Phosphate, Monobasic, Dihydrate with its explicit two-water formula. This term was already known in open758/901: fresh confirmation is not a novel promotion authorization. Section3 specific-term precedence means a future authorized whole758 correction should assess this exact term rather than mechanically broad-mapping the dihydrate to anhydrous37585. No CAS, drug role or other property is transferred here. The full frozen2956-owner and planned3550-owner structured reference scan found no existingNCITC66551 owner or incoming component reference to the localdihydrate ID; that does not discharge the separate routing/membership coupling.
+
+Both W08 fragments touch two unique KG cases, with the mono case shared. The prior three-stock deferrals cover four different cases. All six remain represented in the original1879 case ledger. If only these stated changes are made and W07 is retained, arithmetic is930 operations and1013 selected origins versus original934/1018; these are conditional deltas, not final campaign counts, because other findings are still being triaged.
+
+Actual state distinction: the cancelled original B had already written TARGET023 among its27 completed operations, so its mono owner is8e383 while its dihydrate remaineda22. The fresh corrected B2 still had e116/a22 at root's documented readback. The corrected1237 comment6724902271 and its exact receipt are captured. No observation in this packet treats cancelled B as an after-state or applies/rolls back either root.
+
+Dedup and scope: scientific coupling remains open758 (comment6596793235); campaign admission defect is filed1237 comment6724902271.901 remains a broader form-grounding backlog, and historical342/321 remain history. Root corrected the earlier misleading cancelled-root statement transparently; use only the corrected readback for present disposition. C authored the earlier combined/admissibility assembly and is not an independent vote on it. B's distinct assessment is separately bound. No source proposal, case, payload, mapping, review, config, native gate or process was changed by this packet.
+'''.replace('\n+','\n')
